            {
              "type": "TEXT",
              "id": "",
              "nodes": [],
              "textData": {
                "text": "Alex and Jordan also run through New Zealand's deposit-taker licensing timeline, Bangladesh's bad-loan crisis and the Bank of Korea's warning on leveraged chip derivatives before closing with the week's action items.",
